<title>HONG KONG: Far East Cons interim net off 71.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Far East Cons interim net off 71.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>	    (in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 4.06	 vs  14.84</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  3.0	  vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	10.79 gain vs  64.61 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  30.83	vs  109.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		   229.46     vs  264.73</p>
<p>    Company name	     Far East Consortium International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		Dec 31, 1996 to Jan 3, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 February 3, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Far East Consortium is an investment holding and property investment company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties and fixed assets.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
